<title>FINLAND: ALANDSBANKEN SEES 96 INCOME TO MATCH 95.</title>
<headline>ALANDSBANKEN SEES 96 INCOME TO MATCH 95.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish bank group Alandsbanken Ab said on Friday it expects its full-year 1996 total income to match 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;Total income is expected to be at the previous year's level,&quot; Alandsbanken said in a statement with its January-September results. It did not comment on profit.</p>
</text>
